ENTRY            K2818   20260831   20260908   20260908       K025
SUBENT        K2818001   20260831   20260908   20260908       K025
BIB                 12         20
TITLE      Photoneutron emission process on nuclei around A=200
           for giant dipole resonance energies based on neutron
           energy and angular distribution
AUTHOR     (N.T.H.Thuong, T.Sanami, H.Yamazaki, N.Iwamoto,
            T.Itoga, Y.Kirihara, E.Lee, K.Sugihara, S.Miyamoto,
            S.Hashimoto, Y.Asano)
INSTITUTE  (2JPNSOK,2JPNKEK,2JPNJAE,2JPNJSR,2JPNOSA,2JPNHIT)
REFERENCE  (J,PL/B,870,139900,2025)
INC-SOURCE (LCS)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element.
           - Physical-form of target is solid.
METHOD     (TOF,PSD)
FACILITY   (SRING,2JPNHIT) NewSUBARU
DETECTOR   (SCIN) Liquid scintillators (NE213)
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) The uncertainty involves neutron counting,
                      the number of incident photons, detection
                      efficiency, and the solid angle.
STATUS     (TABLE,,T.H.T.Nguyen+,J,PL/B,870,139900,2025) Fig. 4
HISTORY    (20260226C) K.S.
           (20260603R) Received by e-mail from T. Nguyen.
ENDBIB              20
COMMON               1          3
EN
MEV
 12.7
ENDCOMMON            3
